<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SEPT EXPORTS THROUGH PORTS FALL 5.6 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SEPT EXPORTS THROUGH PORTS FALL 5.6 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish exports through ports</p>
<p>fell 5.6 percent year-on-year in September to 2.54 million</p>
<p>tonnes, the Board of Navigation said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In January-September, exports through ports fell 6.5 percent</p>
<p>year-on-year to 24.28 million tonnes.</p>
<p>September imports through ports fell 2.3 percent to 3.38</p>
<p>million tonnes and January-September imports fell 0.6 percent to</p>
<p>26.26 million tonnes, the board said.</p>
<p>The Board of Navigation gave the following statistics of</p>
<p>foreign trade via ports (tonnes unless stated):</p>
<p>EXPORTS</p>
<p>			   ----------------- 1996 --------------------</p>
<p>			    Sept    change yr/yr Jan-Sept change yr/yr</p>
<p>  TOTAL (mln tonnes) 2.536     -0.151	  24.276	 -1.698</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>  Paper		675,194    -55,411     5,827,777     -823,104</p>
<p>  Pulp		 114,389	 -856     1,077,054     +100,907</p>
<p>  Sawn goods	 256,146    -50,317     2,517,016     -316,148</p>
<p>  Chemicals	  164,387    -59,872     1,567,200     -758,576</p>
<p>Metals,</p>
<p>  metal products   135,912    -45,053     1,572,651     -276,691</p>
<p>IMPORTS</p>
<p>			   ----------------- 1996 --------------------</p>
<p>			    Sept    change yr/yr Jan-Sept change yr/yr</p>
<p>  TOTAL (mln tonnes) 3.377	-0.088	 26.257	 -0.552</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>  Crude oil	  554,902    -134,976    5,072,682     -579,728</p>
<p>  Oil products     310,003     +82,069    2,879,862     +730,392</p>
<p>Raw minerals,</p>
<p>   cement	    371,542    -59,088     2,520,790     -381,040</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
